{"version":1,"content":"<p>汽車智能化程度不斷提高，正在讓維修變得更貴、更慢，並間接推高保險費用。一項新調查顯示，美國獨立維修店因獲取和使用汽車製造商的維修軟件而損失的時間，每年價值約120億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587666.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:34:53.821443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:22:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_hash":"0f337e8a29f87c2c86f486d9f7dcc92bcc1c59b12bfeda87fc5d46e54c037694","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}